Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 689 "Collecting Mana Pieces II"
    Journal for karus "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Aldos."
    Collect 5 of 389470000

Requires player level >= 67 and quest 688 is completed

Rewards
    Give 10000000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Got a call, he needs the second [Mana Piece]. Go to [Chief Researcher] Gaz."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "So I see you again. You had no choice? Hmm... you could refuse if you want to. Well...enough of idle talk."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Anyway, next [Mana Pieces] that you should collect are [Impure Mana Pieces] of [Death Wizards]. They, also called as a psycho-pump, absorb the last consciousness from their victims and accumulate impure energies in their body during that evil deed. However, the numbers of those [Death Wizards] have increased enormously in recent days. Please hurry.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Gaz in Eslant has asked for [Impure mana pice] from the [Death Wizards]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "So I see you again. You had no choice? You could refuse if you want to. Well...enough of idle talk."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Anyway, next [Mana Pieces] that you should collect are [Impure Mana Pieces] of [Death Wizards]. They, also called as a psycho-pump, absorb the last consciousness from their victims and accumulate impure energies in their body during that evil deed. However, the numbers of those [Death Wizards] have increased enormously in recent days. Please hurry.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Aldos in Eslant has asked for [Impure mana pice] from the [Death Wizards]."

On in_progress
    Say "It's [Impure Mana Piece] from the [Death Wizard]. Understand?  [Death Wizard] and [Impure Mana Piece]!"

On claimable
    Show quest "So this is [Impure Mana Piece]. Let's hurry and see the reaction..\n\nLet's see ...next I need [Bitter mana piece]. As you can expect, you can get it from [Apostle of Piercing Cold]. It is a magical creature that uses the cold magic. Please go get it."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "Please come back to me when you reach Lv67. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Please come back to me when you reach Lv68. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
